# Layer 4 (CR 613.1d), AddType$ read by the intrinsic mana ability. Blanket of
# Night's S:Mode$ Continuous | Affected$ Land | AddType$ Swamp makes each
# Mountain a Swamp in addition, and a Swamp taps for {B} (CR 305.6), so two
# Mountains pay for Walking Corpse ({1}{B}), which Mountains alone could not.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 B
tapformana human 3 B
queue paygeneric B
castspell human 1
resolvestack
